VSRToM code release
Copyright VSRToM contributors.

The task prompts, response parsing, Qwen2.5-VL adapter and DePeR flow are
adapted from the VSRToM implementation built on lmms-eval:
https://github.com/EvolvingLMMs-Lab/lmms-eval
Copyright (c) 2025 LMMs-Lab.

The original lmms-eval license notice is retained in
third_party/lmms-eval-LICENSE. Its core harness uses MIT; its multimodal
model/task contributions use Apache License 2.0. This standalone release
uses Apache License 2.0 and does not vendor the full evaluation harness.

Modifications for this release: standalone CLI, configurable resources,
removal of private configuration and unrelated experimental methods,
explicit input validation, separate round records, and tests. The dataset
labeling/sampling functions and retained prompt strings come from the
research implementation. See docs/REPRODUCIBILITY.md for scope.

Qwen2.5-VL, Grounding DINO and Orient Anything are external dependencies.
No third-party model weights, images, 3D assets, participant records or
benchmark datasets are included. Their licenses are not replaced by the
code license in this repository.
